@@ -0,0 +1,3 @@
+### Fixed
+- Fixed that collapsing a meta task in the Voxelytics workflow DAG, or opening it in the extra view, also included other tasks whose names merely start with the meta task's name (e.g., `segmentation` for `segment`).
+- Fixed that a Voxelytics meta task containing only nested meta tasks was shown at the top level of the task list instead of inside its parent meta task.
